BT /F1 12 Tf 50 720 Td 18 TL (ProofLens Global Corp - Employee Handbook 2026) ' (Section 1: Working Hours and Hybrid Work Model) ' (All full-time employees operate on a flexible hybrid schedule requiring 3 days in-office and 2 days remote.) ' (Core collaboration hours are strictly defined from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM IST.) ' (Total weekly working hours expected are 40 hours across Monday through Friday.) ' ET
