BT /F1 12 Tf 50 720 Td 18 TL (Section 2: Leave Policy and Medical Benefits) ' (Employees are entitled to 20 days of Paid Annual Leave and 12 days of Casual/Sick Leave per calendar year.) ' (Maternity leave provides 26 fully paid weeks for eligible female employees.) ' (Paternity leave offers 4 fully paid weeks to be utilized within 6 months of childbirth.) ' (Comprehensive health insurance covers up to 500,000 INR per family unit including parents.) ' ET
