BT /F1 12 Tf 50 720 Td 18 TL (Section 3: Separation, Probation and Notice Periods) ' (The standard probation period for new joiners is 6 months from date of onboarding.) ' (During the probation period, either party may terminate employment with 30 days written notice.) ' (Post confirmation, the mandatory notice period is 90 calendar days.) ' (Notice buyout requires explicit written approval from Department Head and Human Resources.) ' ET
